# Shared Package — Import Guide

**Quick Reference:**
| Scope | Path |
|-------|------|
| Shared types/enums | `@oneohm-epc/shared/types` |
| Shared utilities | `@oneohm-epc/shared/utils` |
| Shared schemas (Zod) | `@oneohm-epc/shared/schemas` |
| Shared constants | `@oneohm-epc/shared/constants` |
| Backend only | `modules/[feature]/types/` |
| Backend decorators | `common/decorators/` |
| Frontend only | `lib/types/` |
